==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{unk|ru|title=Uncertain}}. Believed to be from {{der|ru|pal|pmbk'|t=cotton}} through some Mediterranean term for cotton wool and/or cloth, since first attestations of the root in the 15th and 16th centuries are mostly with a now obsolete sense, the only remnant of which in modern active vocabulary is {{l|ru|хлопчатобумажный|t=made from cotton}}. First paper was imported to Russia from Italy and Greece.

